          {
            "date": "Mar 31, 2020",
            "id": "ecaac8e6-b064-4fa5-96ab-e4794aba9532",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Monica, we are thrilled to hear that you enjoyed your stay in WaterColor. We absolutely agree that this home is in an amazing location and is beautifully decorated. Thank you for staying with 360 Blue and we look forward to hosting you again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We can't stop talking about this vacation. We had a wonderful time - we always do on 30A! But this house was especially perfect for our family and friends from where it was located to how it was laid out and decorated! We'd love to come back!",
        "title": "October 2019 Stay"
      },
      {
