          {
            "date": "Mar 31, 2020",
            "id": "b6d7cca3-06f7-44c7-90c5-f8bc08dc38f7",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "What a great photo, Rob! Everyone looks like they are having so much fun. Thank you for sharing. We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed your stay in WaterColor. We certainly agree that this home is a great place to spend quality time together with family. Thank you for staying with 360 Blue. We look forward to seeing you all again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house and accommodations were fantastic fit for our family. We look forward to the opportunity to return and certainly would look first to coming back to 241. Many thanks for a wonderful setting to enjoy family time.\n\nTruly, The Addington's",
        "title": "October 2019 Stay"
      },
